          ],
          [
            "paused",
            "said"
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "source": "Tess of the d'Urbervilles (Hardy), LitBank 110",
        "text": "The lad quickened his pace and came near.",
        "pairs": [
          [
            "quickened",
